{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-kb#card-zh","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-kb","commit":"cd3654e9ea6bb63172b8670370ee3d2928d72def","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@weibaohui/dsh-kb 是面向 DSH Web 的团队知识库插件。它在侧栏提供知识库页面，并通过同源 API 浏览目录、阅读 Markdown 和搜索本地文件。用户可以创建多个素材库或只读产出库，上传的 raw 素材可进入串行队列，由 bot 会话按每库约定整理为 wiki 页面。插件也提供正文与约定编辑、版本历史、回收站、页面反馈和下载。适合希望跨会话沉淀团队资料并检索复用的 DSH Web 用户；不需额外 API Key，自动蒸馏使用宿主配置的模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:536","src/index.js:576","src/index.js:665","src/kb-core.js:247","client/index.js:6"]}
{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-kb#card-en","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-kb","commit":"cd3654e9ea6bb63172b8670370ee3d2928d72def","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"In DSH Web, @weibaohui/dsh-kb provides a knowledge base with browsing, Markdown reading, and text search. Users can keep multiple libraries, upload raw files for serial bot distillation, and edit or restore wiki pages. No separate API key is needed; distillation uses the model configured in DSH.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:536","src/index.js:576","src/index.js:665","src/kb-core.js:247","client/index.js:6"]}
