{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-kb#caveat-model","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-kb","commit":"cd3654e9ea6bb63172b8670370ee3d2928d72def","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"@weibaohui/dsh-kb 使用自动蒸馏时依赖宿主配置好的模型；插件可选配 provider 与 model 覆盖默认路由，模型不可用时素材仍可留在队列。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:124","src/index.js:728","src/index.js:748"]}
{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-kb#caveat-path","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-kb","commit":"cd3654e9ea6bb63172b8670370ee3d2928d72def","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"@weibaohui/dsh-kb 默认知识库根目录为 ~/.dsh/kb，也可用 DSH_KB_ROOT 指定其他本机目录；队列和快照状态写在 DSH_HOME 数据目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/kb-core.js:766","src/index.js:41","src/index.js:468","src/index.js:491"]}
